        {
          "sourceId": "en:body",
          "quote": "Hwei paints visions of disaster that deal large damage to enemies. Devastating Fire Hwei launches a blazing fast fireball that explodes on the first enemy hit, dealing (50/80/110/140/170 + (80% Ability Power)) plus 3/4/5/6/7% max health magic damage. Severing Bolt Hwei strikes over far distances with a delayed lightning bolt, dealing (60/85/110/135/160 + (30% Ability Power)) magic damage. Hitting an Isolated or Immobilized target increases the damage up to (120/201.875/302.5/421.875/560 + (60/71.25/82.5/93.75/105% Ability Power)) magic damage, based on the target's missing health. Molten Fissure Hwei unleashes a path of eruptions, dealing (20/35/50/65/80 + (30% Ability Power)) magic damage in an area and leaving behind pools of lava that Slow enemies by 35% and deal (20/35/50/65/80 + (24% Ability Power)) magic damage per second for 2.5 seconds."
        }
